{"game": "alien-swarm", "language": "english", "appid": 630, "month": "2025-11", "window": 1, "start_date": 1761955200, "end_date": 1764547199, "month_true_total": 19, "quota": 19, "returned": 19, "pulled_at": "2026-10-06 01:11:56 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "211868387", "author": {"steamid": "76561198872954951", "personaname": "Caydos", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/caydos/", "num_games_owned": 963, "num_reviews": 191, "playtime_forever": 1797, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1797, "last_played": 1764502999, "avatar": "18cf9e93edbe79213f24fd277a0c8fc05e9ec68f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Not for this day and age. Just play the new version that is better in every way.\n\nAlien Swarm: Reactive Drop that is. Even though don't expect much as it was released in 2017 and this game's community has always been small but worth trying imo. It is an online Valve game, although moderation is separate on the newer one. What I mean is, expect a great game of which the fun is destroyed by toxic foul players, cheaters and hackers. Just like in any other online/multiplayer game, particularly Valve ones. I guess Valve games are attracting these type of people because they are good, cheap or heck even free. I recommend playing with friends.", "timestamp_created": 1764504226, "timestamp_updated": 1764504226, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.496183186769485474", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "211812158", "author": {"steamid": "76561198815236168", "personaname": "redacted 176", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198815236168/", "num_games_owned": 186, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 233, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 233, "last_played": 1656354979, "avatar": "cfc91b2522b122a103dba607eebbebf808573134"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's a shame the game has so few players, it most definitely needs more, because the main issue I have with the game actively amounts to \"it was designed for multiple people but barely has any players\"\nGame deserves a revival, I know it won't get one, but I wish it could. In other words, play it with a friend or two, maybe a third, maybe not so that you find some random guy who can either solo the entire mission or someone else who you can friend", "timestamp_created": 1764480844, "timestamp_updated": 1764480896, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "211784336", "author": {"steamid": "76561198122983088", "personaname": "Matseuu", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198122983088/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 279, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 279, "last_played": 1764466316, "avatar": "8b84adbdb97b0f57819150d36cc300715d8ba5c5"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good co-op game, is from valve so everything is so polished", "timestamp_created": 1764466755, "timestamp_updated": 1764466755, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.519826710224151611", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "211636159", "author": {"steamid": "76561198017166312", "personaname": "native", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "ht