e game by valve, unfortunately Ive always had problems with this game either not every booting because of an SDK at times, and if booting sometimes crashing randomly. Not sure why. Still great game though, and its probably not that common of an issue. Its like a top down L4D in a sort of way. Its not in depth, and it only has one campaign as it was quickly abandoned, which is super unfortunate, making it one of the few abandoned Valve games with hardly any players, though there are a few you will find today. Its a Ricochet but for Source, effectively a tech demo so you also go in knowing that and you are much more willing to forgive what it was left behind as. Still a great free game.\n\n7.7/10", "timestamp_created": 1764189077, "timestamp_updated": 1764189077, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52219468355178833", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "210586442", "author": {"steamid": "76561198510905251", "personaname": "aheadgamer2003", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/bravoandres636/", "num_games_owned": 51, "num_reviews": 34, "playtime_forever": 73, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 73, "last_played": 1549233369, "avatar": "8d7f75f153f517bbb534776430f923b9ae318d12"}, "language": "english", "review": "Go play Alien Swarm Reactive Drop.", "timestamp_created": 1764092646, "timestamp_updated": 1764092646, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.492898225784301758", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "209915526", "author": {"steamid": "76561198